  id: cinder_caster
  displayName: Cinder Caster
  description: "Badlands volcanic vent. The arena heats up over the course of the
    fight \u2014 player needs heat resistance."
  tier: 1
  family: 3
  behaviors:
  - "Arena temperature rises every 30 seconds \u2014 player takes burn damage without
    protection."
  - Stays mobile to keep distance.
  - Pyro spirit if cleansed; otherwise turns the arena to lava at low HP.
  - Vulnerable when channeling Magma Pillar (channels for 4 seconds).
  abilities:
  - "Molten Volley \u2014 three arc projectiles"
  - "Cinder Step \u2014 leaves fire patches when moving"
  - "Magma Pillar \u2014 vertical column rises from beneath player"
  - "Eruption \u2014 final ability, fills arena with lava"
  dropItemIds:
  - Cinderroot Sigil (Pyro Engine masterwork)
  - Thermal Rock x3
  - Cinderroot Oil x4
  - Spirit Anchor
  boss_section: Channeler Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
